# FM drum (#779): Moritz Klein's FM drum (MKI x ES.EDU) as the ModularFmDrum
# preset, one box tuned five ways into a kit. The key is VCO1, the carrier;
# the velocity is the accent, louder and harder on the hit.
# The panel: Ctl1 amp, Ctl2 ratio (VCO2 as a ratio of VCO1), Ctl3 fm (how far
# VCO2 swings VCO1, semitones), Ctl4 depth (the pitch envelope, semitones),
# Ctl5 pdecay (its fall, s), Ctl6 decay (the VCA's, s), Ctl7 wave (0 the
# diode-rounded sine, 1 the ring mod through the high-pass), Ctl8 drive (the
# distortion on the hit).
tempo 120
swing 54
scale a minor

# sine: a deep kick, a tom, a snare from a wide clanging FM
setting kick = Modular ModularFmDrum: Ctl2 1.5, Ctl3 6, Ctl4 30, Ctl5 0.05, Ctl6 0.45, Ctl7 0, Ctl8 4
setting tom = Modular ModularFmDrum: Ctl2 1.5, Ctl3 12, Ctl4 12, Ctl5 0.1, Ctl6 0.3, Ctl7 0, Ctl8 2
setting snare = Modular ModularFmDrum: Ctl2 2.7, Ctl3 36, Ctl4 12, Ctl5 0.03, Ctl6 0.18, Ctl7 0, Ctl8 6
# pulse: the ring mod, a closed hat and a metal bell
setting hat = Modular ModularFmDrum: Ctl2 2.9, Ctl3 24, Ctl4 0, Ctl6 0.06, Ctl7 1
setting metal = Modular ModularFmDrum: Ctl2 1.41, Ctl3 6, Ctl4 0, Ctl6 0.8, Ctl7 1

track kick synth kick
track tom synth tom
track snare synth snare
track hat synth hat
track metal synth metal

strip kick: Level 0.9
strip tom: Level 0.7, Pan -0.3
strip snare: Level 0.7, Pan 0.1
strip hat: Level 0.6, Pan 0.3, Send2 0.1
strip metal: Level 0.5, Pan -0.2, Send1 0.3, Send2 0.3

clip kicks = kick
  "a1 ~ ~ a1 ~ ~ a1 ~"
clip toms = tom
  "~ ~ ~ ~ ~ [a2 e2] ~ c2"
clip snares = snare
  "~ ~ d3 ~ ~ ~ d3 ~"
clip hats = hat
  "a5 a5 a5 a5 a5 a5 a5 [a5 a5]"
clip bells = metal
  "e5 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~"

scene kick_only 2: kicks
scene groove 4: kicks snares hats
scene fill 2: kicks snares hats toms
scene metal 4: kicks snares hats bells
arrange kick_only groove fill groove metal
